<title>NETHERLANDS: Generale Bank rates Nedlloyd a Hold.</title>
<headline>Generale Bank rates Nedlloyd a Hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Aug 23 research.</p>
<p>    Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Nedlloyd	  shipping	38.30   Generale Bank</p>
<p>COMMENT: Hold (reiterated) - Earnings estimates raised after 2Q results which were above expectations. Ocean Shipping outlook still uncertain due to high level of orders for new vessels and eroding rates - should be able to restore balance between cost cutting and rates erosion. European Transport and Distribution no surprise - expect unit to improve results albeit at slow pace. Neddrill sold and proceeds used for debt repayment.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	1.69     22.6    1.25</p>
<p>    1996		   2.50     15.3    1.25</p>
<p>    1997		   4.00     9.6     1.25</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
